⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
309 calories 37g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

The Tonight Dough Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Book with over 150 recipes like this one!

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake (350-400ml)
- 20-25g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 10g cocoa powder
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 20g UUL Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough bites
- 2 OREO Thins (cream removed)
- 7g caramel syrup
309 cal 33g C, 7g F, 37g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the Oreos
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
8. Top with the cookie dough bites and caramel syrup

